Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:38.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,《死神来了》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:28.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法国观光）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:31.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（推销员之死）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:01.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一命呜呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德和乔治的爸爸刚刚来电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tod and George's dad just called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说明天下午3：30来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's picking you up at 3.30 tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,五点巴士从学校出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bus leaves the high school for the airport around 5.00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的皮包好用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's my suitcase working out for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 不要拆标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you got to leave that on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸上次带着标签搭飞机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tag made the last flight without the plane crashing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有出事 应该保留\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I figure it's got to be on or with the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吉祥物\N{\fnArial\fs30}For luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡思乱想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you get a nutball idea like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才17岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, seventeen, on the loose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群野马\N{\fnArial\fs30}senior trip with your friends in Paris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到巴黎渡假十日\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten days in the springtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁青春 好好开心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live it up.You got your whole life ahead of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 让叔叔帮你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitchcock, let me give you a hand with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, you dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你遗留在巴士上的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You left this on the bus. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 让我们帮你拿点行李吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on let's get your stuff together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 姬丝黛…贝丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Christa.Hi, Blake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做什么？- 你们的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - He's the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,带齐行李没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.You guys got everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 都带齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dad, we're all set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是指可以起程吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你们两个的 玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for both of you.Have a great time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是给我们两个的 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Both of us. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾力克斯 照顾一下他们 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alex, take care of them. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,校刊上我的照片真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think anything could look worse than my yearbook photo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我 从早到晚就听你罗嗦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think I feel having to look at you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.97,0:06:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叽里咕噜什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上不准乘客生事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The airport does not endorse solicitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,死 并非一了百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:37.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（世界并非只有物质）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再骚扰我学生 你就一了百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be for you if you harass my students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,神会保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hare Rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to ask you a few questions this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,行李是你自己收拾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pack your bags yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在你身边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your belongings been in your possession the entire time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（取消）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布郎宁先生？- 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Browning? - Oh Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有接过陌生人的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you received any packages from persons unknown to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:20.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点：巴黎戴高乐机场）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和你生日一样 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same as your birthday. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生于9月25日，起飞是9点25分\N{\fnArial\fs30}September 25.9.25.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日和起飞时间一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your birthday's the same as your departure time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off, dude.Dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸说给的钱我们两个都有份\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, Dad said both of us.Give me some cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨…不要闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! Hi! Knock it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎观光）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起去拉屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go take a shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己去拉个够 - 不 一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take a shit by yourself. - No, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 不如讲些有意思的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen OK? Take some knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个钟头飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to board a seven-hour flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上厕所不通风\N{\fnArial\fs30}The toilets in coach are barely ventilated closets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.87,0:08:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞到半路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say halfway through the flight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进去拉屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}your body wants that aeroplane food out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉完屎出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go torque a wicked cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一姬丝黛或者贝丽接着进去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then directly after you, walks in Christa or Blake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你留在马桶内的杰作…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want them to associate you with that watery sting in their eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不反胃才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reflexive gag at the back of their throat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是约翰？丹华唱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Denver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞机死…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died in a plane crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for your patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞往巴黎的180号班机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this time, we would like to begin preboarding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…即将登机 乘客们请前往46号登机口\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Volee Air flight 180 to Paris through gate 46.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见比利？希治格吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone seen Billy Hitchcock? How did we lose him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上有小孩 多数不会失事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good sign.Younger, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则上帝必定心理变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be a fucked-up God to take down this plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许真的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}A really fucked-up God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.47,0:11:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 托德 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Tod. - Hello.How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟姬丝黛换个位置吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you switch seats with Christa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 但我随时要小便\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I would, but I got a bladder thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尿道发炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a urinary tract infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问艾力克斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go ask Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 换个位？我想和贝丽坐一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you trade seats so Blake and I could sit together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她问过托德 他说他得了什么病\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked Tod, but he had some medical thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求求你 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please? - Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好人 艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so sweet.Thanks, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为在飞机上可以泡到马子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think we'd titty-fuck them over Greenland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得我吃得都没胃口 全程只看一级片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, I got to watch fucking "Stuart Little"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真够朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks man.That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my seat right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Ain't going that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位系好\N{\fnArial\fs30}To properly fasten your seat belts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}slide the flat portion into the buckle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上其有6个紧急出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are six emergency exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个在前 两个位于机翼侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two doors in front two over the wings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个在后边\N{\fnArial\fs30}two at the rear of the aircraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务员 准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight attendants, prepare for departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 换个位？我想和贝丽坐一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex? Could you trade seats so Blake and I could sit together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她问过托德 他说他得了什么病\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked Tod, but he had some medical thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 什么事？- 搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a problem, sir? - What's your fucking problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机会爆炸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fucking plane's going to explode!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴！布郎宁 - 搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Browning. - You're so not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不应该开玩笑… - 不是开玩笑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If this is a joke… - It's not a joke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞机会坠毁 - 乱讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down! - It's going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能要下飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll remove you if this continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking remove myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个座位是我的 - 游戏会继续进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my seat. - This plane is going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,通道上的人 全都下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody in the aisle off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都坐好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay where you are.Sit tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好 飞机会坠毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fucking plane is going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟他去 照顾他一下 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go check him out.See how he's doing. - Ok{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有闹事 放手！- 放手 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the fuck off me! - Let go, jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他 不要放他们上机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this? No one gets back on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:17:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的命令 - 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my call. - Wait, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有40个学生去巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got forty students going to Paris.Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请明白我的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand my position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, and I apologize for Alex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上的学生不能没有教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}but one of us needs to be on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让这些学生自己去巴黎10天的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot let those students go to Paris for ten days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 停手！坐下 卡特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit the fuck down, Carter! Sit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之中 只准一个上机\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you can go on the flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,机师态度强硬 只准你或我上机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not taking this well.One of us can get back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟三个小时后搭另一班\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest can take an 11.10 flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上机吧 你懂法语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the French thing.Get on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才上了厕所 才出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I was in the bathroom, and the lock was stuck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 我没有生事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I didn't fight with anyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母正在赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called your parents.They're on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 究竟什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, talk to me.Tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见飞机从跑道起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}l saw it on the runway, I saw it take off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从窗口望出去 望到地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw out my window, I saw the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,机舱开始震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the cabin, it starts to shake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边飞脱 跟着飞机爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The left side blows up and the whole plane explodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得清清楚楚 和真的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was so real, like how everything happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见惯飞机爆炸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been on a lot of planes that blew up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必定睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们延迟半日去巴黎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get thrown off the plane and blow a half day in Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为艾力克斯做他妈的噩梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because Browning has a bad fucking dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 且慢…糟了 飞机会爆炸 飞机会爆炸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! The plane, it's going to blow up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧！卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Horton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去巴黎？进医院就有你份！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only trip you're taking is to the fucking hospital!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他！艾力克斯 住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off him! Alex, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼巴巴看着别人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they go, here we stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你赔偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're paying for my trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你没留在机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you were on that plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贱人！- 哦 见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fucking prick! - Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快打电话 - 安保！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call it in! - Security!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么望着我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at me as if I caused this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't cause this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人生还？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有… - 这不是巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think I'm some… - He's not a witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫薛高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Howard Seigel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输安全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}National Transportation and Safety Board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的家人接到通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've contacted all your families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,正赶来的途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要见医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone here who feels they might need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要见神父或是牧师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}medical attention or spiritual counselling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？有没有人生还？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Are there any survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸的原因未明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cause for the explosion is still undetermined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援队抵达现场后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nassau County authorities are on the scene…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开海上搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}naval search and rescue en route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 我是温纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.I'm Agent Weine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是希瑞克 联邦调查局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Agent Schreck.We're with the FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你们的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand how you all must be feeling…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你们非常的困难…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know it's going to be difficult…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁记忆犹新…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to ask questions regarding today's events…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不问几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they're still fresh in your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论对于拯救 调查…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will prove invaluable to our rescue attempts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所提供的数据 都很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and any potential criminal investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说：听我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机起飞后会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This plane will explode on takeoff."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weird feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有服过镇定剂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take any sedatives before boarding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在飞机上你有没有服用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}On board, did you take any sleeping pills…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,安眠药 或迷幻药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}narcotics, hallucinogens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸不吸毒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you take any drugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.57,0:21:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预先见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到将会发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到飞机爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the plane explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸前 你说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the weird feelings have anything to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「可惜卡特没留在机上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your saying you wished Carter Horton was on it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那样说 因为预感？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before it exploded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 为什么那样说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why'd you say it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不以为飞机真的会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't really think it was going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the case, Alex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么下飞机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you really get off the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥叫我下飞机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother George…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}he told me to go keep an eye on Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是哥哥留在机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so he stayed and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.87,0:22:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我下机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to get off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉利叫我上机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry Murnau said I should get back on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为他上机比较适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I told him that he should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他上机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him back on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:22:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.47,0:22:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人逼你下飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody forced you off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟下飞机的同学也不熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you weren't friends with those that were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 那么你为什么下飞机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, Clear, why did you get off the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我看到 听到艾力克斯的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I saw and I heard Alex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你送我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,9点25分 180号班机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking at the first piece of debris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.91,0:25:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从纽约肯尼迪机场起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wash ashore from Volee Air flight 180…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.47,0:25:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,随即发生爆炸 爆炸碎片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which erupted shortly after a 9.25 p.m.takeoff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始冲上沙滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}from John F.Kennedy Airport in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.41,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,据悉未有生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no known survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机燃料仍在海面燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coast Guard and naval search and rescue efforts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.41,0:25:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,水警与海军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}are continuing at this moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在海上搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}even as jet fuel burns on the ocean's surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.37,0:25:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于寻获生还者的机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities are pessimistic about the possibility…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局认为微乎其微\N{\fnArial\fs30}of finding anyone alive from the ill-fated flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,287名乘客 可能全部遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}All 287 passengers are feared dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amongst the travellers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.47,0:25:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自阿伯拉罕山中学…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a class of forty students and four teachers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,40名学生 4位教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Mount Abraham High School in south-east New York…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.51,0:25:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该批师生拟赴巴黎参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}en route to Paris on a field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.81,0:25:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,起机前\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are reports several students…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.87,0:25:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,数名学生因事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}were removed from the aircraft moments before departure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被驱逐下机 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}however, investigators remain guarded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,详情未获披露\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the specifics of this incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输安全局和联邦调查局…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities from National Transportation and Safety…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.11,0:26:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,两局人员已经到抵达现场…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Federal Bureau of lnvestigation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.51,0:26:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,着手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}have arrived at JFKto begin the initial investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场与附近的长岛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyewitnesses at the airport, as well as on Long lsland…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有人目击这次爆炸意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}report seeing the plane explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,肇事上空 当时并没有其它飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No other aircraft were visibly near flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,航机控制员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At JFK, air traffic controllers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.87,0:26:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,正研究目击者口供\N{\fnArial\fs30}are corroborating these eyewitness accounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.87,0:26:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸碎片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the explosion, debris apparently rained…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,散播在大西洋数英里范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the Atlantic Ocean for several miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 调查人员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigators are cautious about verifying these accounts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍未能确定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}believing they'll learn more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.37,0:26:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,39日前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-nine days have passed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.97,0:27:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们痛失39位\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we lost our thirty-nine loved ones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.51,0:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱师友\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends, and teachers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.37,0:27:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,空难的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}As each day passes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.97,0:27:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一日未查明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a determining cause for the accident…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的心结一日不能解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ask ourselves, "Why?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:14.34,Title,0,0,0,0,,圣经《传道书》这样说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ecclesiastes" tells us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.37,0:27:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡何时出现 殊难逆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Man no more knows his own time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,人就像网中鱼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"than fish taken in the fatal net…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.61,0:27:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼中鸟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"or birds trapped in the snare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.17,0:27:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,死 往往突如其来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Like these, the children of men caught…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听天由命而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}"when the time falls suddenly upon them."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当伤痛犹新\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, before we can heal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.87,0:27:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡阴霾 徘徊未散\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we escape the presence of death and time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谨立此碑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must mourn and celebrate theirs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.41,0:27:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,悼念亡魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.97,0:28:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要自以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't think because my name ain't on this wall…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.81,0:28:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的救命恩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I owe you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.41,0:28:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死去 我更应该好好地活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I owe these people is to live my life to the fullest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.61,0:28:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就少饮酒为妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay off the J.D., then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.77,0:28:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没资格干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever fucking tell me what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.31,0:28:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命掌握在我自己手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I control my life, not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.07,0:28:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.57,0:29:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在考车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took my driver's test last week at the DMV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.81,0:29:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,考到最低分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a seventy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 总算及格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the lowest score you can get, but I passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.17,0:29:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道不 当我在路考时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, when I was done with the test…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,考牌官对我说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know the guy that drives with you during the test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.21,0:29:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, he goes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「年青人 你会英年早丧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Young man, you're going to die at a very young age."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.97,0:29:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的短命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.57,0:29:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心好了 你吉人天相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, not here, not ever, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.87,0:29:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我可以约仙迪出去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ask out Cynthia Paster, will she say no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.71,0:29:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟我交谈 我怕了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me.You scare the hell out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.07,0:30:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要误会 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to take this the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.61,0:30:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会记的你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I miss you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.57,0:30:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我爸爸不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my father, he doesn't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.37,0:30:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他心情平复…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when he gets over this thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.87,0:30:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一同出城散散心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me, we'll road trip to the city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.21,0:30:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看扬基棒球队\N{\fnArial\fs30}catch the Yanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.85,0:30:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.01,0:30:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.97,0:30:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.07,0:30:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,悼念文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing Ms Lewton showed me in class…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.26,0:30:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师叫我朗诵\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're going to let me read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.51,0:30:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,正说出我的心声\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says what I'm feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.77,0:30:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:30:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠你 我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.87,0:31:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.37,0:31:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗语说 死期难料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say that the hour of death cannot be forecast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.77,0:31:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此 其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when we say this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.27,0:31:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们心底把自己的死亡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we imagine that the hour is placed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当作遥不可及的一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an obscure and distant future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦也想不到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never occurs to us that it has any connection…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.21,0:31:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的生命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the day already begun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.07,0:31:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能随时终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that death could arrive this same afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.27,0:31:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能今天 今午\N{\fnArial\fs30}This afternoon which is so certain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至可能 此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and which has every hour filled in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.83,0:32:57.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（火灾与爆炸）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.13,0:32:59.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（各种空难）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.66,0:33:01.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（空难）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.87,0:33:07.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（机场运作）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.43,0:33:37.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（学生悼念会昨天举行）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:34:00.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阁楼杂志）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.52,0:35:36.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（托德）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.86,0:37:24.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑箱车）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.87,0:37:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.77,0:37:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Tod?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.67,0:37:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你预见不到吗？- 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't you see it? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.37,0:38:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德下机 而哥哥没下机 你令他觉得很内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caused Tod so much guilt over George…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.87,0:38:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.87,0:38:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 他不可能自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! He wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想自杀 怎么会说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey? He said we'd be friends again after you got better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你心情平复 约我出去玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he make plans if he was going to kill himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.37,0:38:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,华格纳先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Waggner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.20,0:38:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,华格纳先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Waggner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎成秋天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost autumn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.87,0:39:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是六月底\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only the end of June.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.17,0:39:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但什么都在转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but everything's always in transition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.27,0:39:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要留意 即使在现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you focus, even now, just one week into summer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.67,0:39:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会感到秋意转浓\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can almost feel autumn coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.11,0:39:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢预测未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like being able to see the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.47,0:39:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚为什么去托德家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you at Tod's house last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从电视里知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen enough TV to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.07,0:39:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦探员去托德家\N{\fnArial\fs30}the FBl doesn't investigate teen suicides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.56,0:39:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是调查自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were there last night.That means, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.97,0:39:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是调查撞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}they still don't have a clue what caused the crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.71,0:39:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们至今还没有头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}they haven't ruled out anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个人事先离开飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fact seven people got off the plane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经够奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is probably weird enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.67,0:39:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个有异能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention, one of those people had a vision…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.11,0:39:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,预见飞机爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever…of the plane exploding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.87,0:40:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机果然爆炸 那就是奇上加奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}minutes before it actually did is highly suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.87,0:40:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,最可疑的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it doesn't help that the visionary's friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的朋友自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}just committed suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.87,0:40:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚为什么去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you there last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.97,0:40:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这塑像是谁 知不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.47,0:40:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.07,0:40:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹簧头是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Springy Head Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.07,0:40:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 不求形似 只求神似\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.Not a likeness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.71,0:40:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带给我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how you make me feel, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.47,0:40:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Like you, the sculpture doesn't even know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.21,0:40:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑像不知情由\N{\fnArial\fs30}what or why it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.57,0:40:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所适从\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's reluctant to take form…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.97,0:40:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,却肯定有一个理念\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet creating an absolute…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.27,0:40:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个抽像而不可解的理念\N{\fnArial\fs30}but incomprehensible attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.17,0:40:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年中学\N{\fnArial\fs30}In four years of high school…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.97,0:40:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们未交谈过半句\N{\fnArial\fs30}we haven't said one word to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.97,0:41:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上你预感到危险 我也预感到\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment, on the plane, I felt what you felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.47,0:41:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发慌 我才察觉是什么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know where those emotions came from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能够预见危险 我不能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you started freaking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.71,0:41:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能预感危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see what you saw, but I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险仍未消除 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still feel it, can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.07,0:41:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那日所发生的事仍未完结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something from that day is still with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.77,0:41:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你预感到 我也预感到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know because I can still feel you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.87,0:41:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我昨晚也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I was there last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.07,0:41:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未面对过死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never dealt with death before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.61,0:41:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只是疑神疑鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could all be in our head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.17,0:41:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,总觉得有异样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just feels like it's all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.37,0:41:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,异样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.37,0:41:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或者难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Tod was just the first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.27,0:41:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,像托德一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的预感？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that something that you're feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.67,0:41:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.07,0:41:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如可以再见到托德见他最后一面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could see him one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.67,0:41:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者可以弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想见他 就去见好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's go see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.47,0:42:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.87,0:42:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心跳得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives me a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.57,0:42:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.07,0:42:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为做不应该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing something I'm not supposed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.67,0:42:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.07,0:42:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.77,0:43:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是他？- 我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that him? - I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.48,0:43:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么化妆成麦克尔？杰克逊一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they make him up like Michael Jackson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.37,0:43:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.07,0:43:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不是托德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it was that made him Tod is definitely gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.67,0:43:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.97,0:43:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵醒长眠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll wake the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.17,0:43:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的手为什么动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd his hand do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.81,0:43:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,化学剂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemicals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.27,0:43:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在血管流动 令到尸身抽搐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vascular flush creates cadaveric spasms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.47,0:43:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 我是他的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm his friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:43:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.37,0:44:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有这瘀痕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are all those tiny marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.37,0:44:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,被铁丝勒到皮下出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuticle lacerations from pulling at the wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.27,0:44:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling at the wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.47,0:44:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是死于自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he was pulling at the wire, he didn't kill himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死于意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.57,0:44:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 没有横死这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In death, there are no accidents…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.71,0:44:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有枉死 惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}no coincidences, no mishaps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.81,0:44:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有注定的一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no escapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像一只老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have to realize is we're all just a mouse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.48,0:44:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,被猫玩弄于指掌之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cat has by the tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.27,0:44:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无论做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single move we make…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡毛蒜皮 抑或丰功伟绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the mundane to the monumental…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.71,0:44:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,停红灯 抑或冲红灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the red light that we stop at or run…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.27,0:44:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟谁做情人 抑或做陌路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people we have sex with or won't with us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.57,0:44:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭飞机 抑或下飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}aeroplanes that we ride or walk out of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.57,0:44:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都属于死亡程序 由死神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all part of death's sadistic design…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.87,0:44:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,预先设计的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ieading to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,预先设计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 如果洞悉了设计…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.97,0:44:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以逃出鬼门关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you figure out the design, you can cheat death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.37,0:44:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你一下飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, you've already done that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.21,0:45:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就已经逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}by walking off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你朋友已经死去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend's departure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.47,0:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是说 死神为你们准备另一套新设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}shows that death has a new design for all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想活命 就要猜测…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have to figure out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.57,0:45:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己会怎样死 几时死\N{\fnArial\fs30}how and when it's coming back at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.67,0:45:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 劫数难逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play your hunch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想逃 唯有凭直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you think you can get away with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.17,0:45:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 记住…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.57,0:45:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺诈和不尊重此设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}the risk of cheating the plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.71,0:45:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可引致愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of disrespecting the design…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.28,0:45:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和恐吓你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}could incite a fury to terrorize even the Grim Reaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不想知道个中道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't even want to fuck with that Mack Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, then.Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.37,0:45:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷进来 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry we broke in, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.47,0:45:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知者不罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm, no foul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.47,0:45:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快会再见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.57,0:46:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个殡仪佬说 死亡是经过设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mortician said that death has a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.51,0:46:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是有迹可寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about omens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.77,0:46:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know, that just by sitting here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.46,0:46:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝咖啡 呼吸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}by sipping this coffee or breathing the air…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.11,0:46:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能引起\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even crossing the intersection…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.28,0:46:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一连串事件…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we haven't started in motion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.37,0:46:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终导致我们若干年后死亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the events that will some day lead to our death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.61,0:46:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,40年 10年 明天 几时死…\N{\fnArial\fs30}forty years from now, ten years, tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.57,0:46:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道 除非我们留意蛛丝马迹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't, unless we open ourselves up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.07,0:46:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,及早洞悉那设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the signs it's willing to show us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.17,0:46:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.87,0:46:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有预见托德死去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see Tod die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.17,0:46:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在机上预见爆炸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it happen again, like on the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.37,0:46:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有预见 但有预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it didn't, but it might as well have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.56,0:46:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从预兆也可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a message from something, Clear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.21,0:46:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,揣摩出设计端倪\N{\fnArial\fs30}or someone, hinting at a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.07,0:46:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找预兆 到处都找到预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can find death omens anywhere you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.01,0:47:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡是黑色 黑色代表死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee starts with a "C" and ends with an "E".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.59,0:47:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样？我们喝咖啡而呛死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does "choke." We'll choke to death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.91,0:47:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的看法有一定道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hear you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.17,0:47:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不可以捕风捉影 走火入魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll go nuts if you start with this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.07,0:47:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,殡仪佬说 死是预先设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mortician said that death has a design, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.01,0:47:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能无意中预见了那设计…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what if you, me, Tod, Carter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.07,0:47:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,令你 我 托德 卡特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry, Billy, Mrs Lewton messed up that design?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.31,0:47:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉 比利 刘老师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever reason, I saw death's plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.51,0:47:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃出鬼门关\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we cheated it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.27,0:47:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if it was our time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.37,0:47:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该死而没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we were not meant to get off that plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍然大限临头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it still is our time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.57,0:47:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,果真如此 我们迟早死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is, then it's not finished…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.27,0:47:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且早死多过迟死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will die.Now, not later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.37,0:47:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非及早察觉蛛丝马迹 再逃出鬼门关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we find the patterns and cheat it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.67,0:47:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听完你这样说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After hearing you, I do believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.27,0:48:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信托德自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Tod killed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.77,0:48:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 不要烦他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, come on, not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人全到齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we have a reunion here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.31,0:48:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.47,0:48:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几时搬走？- 几个星期后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When are you moving? - Couple weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.17,0:48:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可惜… - 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's too bad. - Carter, you dick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.97,0:48:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去一位良师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing our favourite teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.17,0:48:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 我有话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, there's something I need to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离乡别井 你们不可不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived here your whole life, and now she's gotta move…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.07,0:48:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有危险！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in danger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.47,0:48:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吵闹了！你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Both of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.96,0:49:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,人死不能复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died, and we lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.41,0:49:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.57,0:49:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠机的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let this plane crash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会耿耿于怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}be the most important thing in my life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.81,0:49:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.37,0:49:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过新日子 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving on, Carter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.97,0:49:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要浪费时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you want to waste your life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.17,0:49:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,专找艾力克斯霉气 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}beating the shit out of Alex every time you see him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.91,0:49:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如干脆死掉好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you can just drop fucking dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.27,0:49:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Alex there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.17,0:49:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 他在 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Clear.Yeah, just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.57,0:49:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔又打来 接听吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Clear again.You want to talk to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.47,0:50:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 他在洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear, he's in the shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.37,0:50:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get him to call you back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.91,0:50:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.47,0:50:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's concerned about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.17,0:50:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm concerned about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不跟她谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you talk to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟我谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你和妈妈很关心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you and Mom have both been a big help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.77,0:50:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我暂时没话说 有些问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's something I need to understand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.57,0:50:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己要先\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I can talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.31,0:50:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想通想透\N{\fnArial\fs30}To anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.27,0:50:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输安全局…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The National Transportation Safety Board…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.17,0:50:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就180号班机的爆炸成因…\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a new theory tonight on the cause of the explosion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.31,0:50:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出另一解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Volee Air flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.47,0:50:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个发动机的电路绝缘体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officials believe deterioration of silicone insulation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.21,0:50:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能出现剥落 导致…\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an electrical connector to the scavenger pump…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.91,0:50:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,易燃液体泄漏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}may have leaked combustible fluids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.61,0:50:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德的座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Tod's seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.87,0:50:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触到电制的火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spark beneath the coach cabin in the fuselage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.87,0:50:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃烧起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}may have ignited the fuel line, proceeding to the fuel pump…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.51,0:50:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而引起爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would have set off the catastrophic explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.57,0:51:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}The path of the explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.07,0:51:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先是托德 然后是泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}First was Tod, then it was Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.37,0:51:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡秩序照旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dying in the order they would've died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.01,0:51:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's death's design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个轮到柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms Lewton's next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.37,0:51:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一睡着就梦见泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever I can fall asleep, I see Terry Chaney…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.31,0:51:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,光天化日 突然…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the day, out of nowhere…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.87,0:51:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑里响起自己的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the sound of my own voice in my head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.01,0:51:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对拉利说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}saying to Larry Murnau…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.17,0:51:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂法语\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No.You know the whole French thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.01,0:51:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上机吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Get on the plane."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当日的情形 我总是念念不忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything reminds me of that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.97,0:52:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 所以打算搬走 换换环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm hoping a change will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.77,0:52:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.87,0:52:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我生于斯 长于斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived here my whole life, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.07,0:52:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一草一木都是愉快的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everywhere I looked were great memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.26,0:52:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我只见到拉利和那班学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now all I see is Larry and those kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.27,0:52:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,望出去前院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking out my own front yard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不寒而栗\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes me feel nothing but fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.67,0:52:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗拉 我再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura, I'm going to have to call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.01,0:52:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.27,0:52:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瓦莱丽·柳敦 请问希瑞克探员在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Valerie Lewton.I need Agent Schreck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.77,0:53:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.81,0:53:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.17,0:53:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,查查车胎 看看安不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}checking the air in the tyre to make sure it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.07,0:53:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on your seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.77,0:54:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.47,0:54:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Ms Lewton is next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.37,0:54:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.47,0:54:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, next, because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有个模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's this pattern that's occurring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.57,0:54:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,模式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.A pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.57,0:54:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也察觉到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You noticed that, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.67,0:54:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈爱听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's favourite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.87,0:55:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么模式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about this pattern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.87,0:55:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又预见到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it in one of your visions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.21,0:55:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然心血来潮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you catch it in some TV static?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.27,0:55:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有故弄玄虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked for what happened on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.76,0:55:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要嘲笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are going to sit there and make fun of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管嘲笑好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.67,0:55:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的确救了机上六条人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saved six lives on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.31,0:55:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,同学个个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six lives, and everybody in my entire school…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.71,0:55:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinks I'm a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.17,0:55:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有受惊过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not suffering from post-traumatic stress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.17,0:55:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不以为自己是耶稣再世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a narcissistic deity complex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.47,0:55:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是杀人狂魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going Dahmer on you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是照实直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人人都有个模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a pattern for us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 你也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a pattern for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.37,0:55:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有设定模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a design for everyone, and I don't know how yet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.77,0:55:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定破解这个谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm going to break this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to our attention…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.07,0:57:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难避嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you were under suspicion in this plane explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.51,0:57:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.17,0:57:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没有下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't blow up the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.11,0:57:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是追寻其它线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were ready to move on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.97,0:57:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但生还者一个个死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then the other survivors started to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先是你朋友托德\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, your friend Tod…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.17,0:57:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着是泰莉 当时你在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Terry Chaney, while you were at the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.97,0:57:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 你在柳敦小姐家外出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight, we pick you up at Val Lewton's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.31,0:57:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不能够控制生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has control over life and death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是杀生或者寻死\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless they are taking lives and causing death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.87,0:57:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以保证再不搞出人命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you promise me no one else is going to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.71,0:57:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.08,0:57:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扣留着 怎样保证？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm in here, it's out of my control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.07,0:57:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.53,0:57:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.47,0:57:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子还真邪门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid gives me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没证据控告他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? We got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.67,0:58:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是指控告\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.01,0:58:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有好几次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a couple of moments…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.97,0:58:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I almost believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.17,0:58:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 有时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take this the wrong way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.47,0:58:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你也邪门\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sometimes you give me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.27,0:58:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经衰弱 这只是一只杯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to stop this.It's a stupid mug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.67,0:58:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon you'll be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.41,0:58:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.88,1:01:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.36,1:01:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.60,1:01:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just stay still, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.27,1:01:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.67,1:02:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.37,1:02:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.97,1:02:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not talking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.57,1:02:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't believe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.77,1:02:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有他消息…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does contact you, I think it would be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.36,1:02:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自己安全 你要通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the best interest of your safety if you called us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.87,1:02:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打上面那个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here's my card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.71,1:02:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是免费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toll-free number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.57,1:02:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}lnteresting work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.47,1:02:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, you dick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.97,1:03:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.37,1:03:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,刻上泰莉的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry should be on this wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.67,1:03:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.67,1:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要来这里见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you want us to meet you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为警探在监视我 等我找艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're watching me to see if I go to Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.87,1:03:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要带我去见艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're taking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.01,1:03:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I want to see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.67,1:03:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他知道下个轮到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he knows which one of us is next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.37,1:03:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要超速 知不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive the speed limit, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.01,1:03:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要从右边调头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't pass on the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.17,1:03:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, wait a minute.I'm getting a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.57,1:03:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the next one, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.31,1:03:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, why'd you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.97,1:03:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你再出声 我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you say another word, I'll fucking kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.31,1:04:11.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（意外调查现场）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.14,1:04:17.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（琼斯海滩 州立公园）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.07,1:04:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里起一英里内 可能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be anywhere from here to a mile down the road…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.17,1:04:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从那边找 我们在中间会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you guys start that way and meet back in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.37,1:04:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头找寻 省一半时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take half the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.07,1:04:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不会还在天上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they're still up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.17,1:05:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂会不会还在180班机里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, flight 180, are they still in flight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.61,1:05:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会活在另一个世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere…are they safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.27,1:05:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid, like six or seven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.10,1:05:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,六七岁 很担心失去父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to worry so much about my parents dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.07,1:05:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上醒来 睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying awake at night, just worrying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.87,1:05:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多小孩都有这样的心理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most kids do, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.37,1:05:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多小孩都未失去父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most kids never have it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.87,1:05:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was ten…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.27,1:05:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸去商店买烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad went into a 7-11 for cigarettes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.77,1:05:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到有人说：不要转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He heard someone say, "Don't turn around."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.57,1:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为是朋友开玩笑 转了身\N{\fnArial\fs30}On reflex, or thinking it was a friend joking, he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即被人轰掉脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy blew his head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.47,1:05:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此 我们苦不堪言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life became shit after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.27,1:05:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈挨不住巨变 再嫁\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom couldn't deal anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.77,1:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继父是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She married this asshole who my mom with my real dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.87,1:05:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前 我父母绝不跟这种人来往\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have crossed the street to avoid this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.37,1:05:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,继父不要小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't really want a kid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.77,1:06:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈只好撇开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so my mom didn't, either, anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.07,1:06:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如死神给我家这样的设计…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that was the design for my father and family…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.47,1:06:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 死神最好应该去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}then fuck death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.47,1:06:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常希望有另一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I have thought a lot about that somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.97,1:06:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It exists, that place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.91,1:06:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸平平安安\N{\fnArial\fs30}where my dad is safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.77,1:06:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚他已经有烟 不用去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where he had a full pack of cigarettes and kept driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.37,1:06:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一家三口 照常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where me and my mom and my dad are still together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.97,1:06:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道现在的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have no idea about this life here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.17,1:06:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们的同学还在天上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where our friends are still in the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.81,1:06:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都再有个生存机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where everyone gets a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.27,1:06:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我们不可以放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, we can't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.57,1:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不可以回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go home, because after Mrs Lewton…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.30,1:06:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师死了 警方在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're looking for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.97,1:06:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们载你到我爸的小屋暂避\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking you to my dad's cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.31,1:06:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,距些几里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a couple of miles from my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.87,1:06:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这样神通广大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Browning, you fucking warlock…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.59,1:07:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道柳敦老师死去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you hear about Ms Lewton or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.24,1:07:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师没死 我也不用躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I was hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.17,1:07:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利告诉警方 你从她家跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy told the FBl he saw you running from her house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.01,1:07:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑 因为警方怀疑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was running 'cause they blame me for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.61,1:07:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀疑我杀托德和柳敦老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}They blame me for Tod, for her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.51,1:07:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the fucking plane crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.87,1:07:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液遇到火 凝固成血浆 艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire caramelized her blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.67,1:07:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场的血浆上有你鞋印 刀上有你指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shoe prints were in it, your fingerprints on the knives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.07,1:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经解释过 我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you they were not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.81,1:07:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about if you did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.47,1:07:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想问你一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even if you knew she was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.37,1:07:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是预先知道她是下一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know she was going to be next before she was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.07,1:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我预先知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.47,1:07:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,预先知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.47,1:07:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们这几个人之中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, out of us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.27,1:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是下一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's next to see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.91,1:07:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.67,1:07:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还未看足球决赛 不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me I'm going to see the Jets win a Super Bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.01,1:07:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 对不对？所以你不回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, right? That's why you're not saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.57,1:07:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连女孩都没摸过 不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have felt up Tammy in the pool that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:07:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗嗦什么？他说下个轮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you whining about? I'm next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.71,1:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说过 专心开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say anything.Just drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.81,1:08:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a responsibility to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.77,1:08:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 会好过吗？卡特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's easier to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.47,1:08:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好过 只会他妈的更难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.It's fucking harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.87,1:08:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不好过不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get off having control over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.07,1:08:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有主张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me decide how to deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.67,1:08:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁先谁后 有什么分别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter who's next…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.61,1:08:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们个个都有份\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're all on the same list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.97,1:08:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.93,1:08:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.17,1:08:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就避也避不开 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why bother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.71,1:08:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the fucking point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.17,1:08:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然迟早去见泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Terry'll be back together on the other side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.21,1:08:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why wait any longer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.17,1:08:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 你做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.27,1:08:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 慢点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.07,1:08:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢点 卡特 - 去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow down, Carter! - Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.57,1:08:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,自杀好过被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}May as well go out on my own free will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.91,1:08:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想陪死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with us in the fucking car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.57,1:09:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 卡特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.47,1:09:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, stop the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.77,1:09:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,未轮到你们 你们怕什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the fucking worry if it ain't your time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.91,1:09:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,下盏红灯我就停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get nailed running this next red light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.91,1:09:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的只是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all wouldn't get shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.41,1:09:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,未必只是你 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.97,1:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知不去巴黎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking hated French class!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.77,1:09:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要发狂 - 我不是发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get control of yourself. - That's what I'm doing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.87,1:09:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都会怕 又不是只有你才怕 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing, and it's all right to be scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.81,1:09:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕 我只是找死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid.I decide when it's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.56,1:09:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是生是死 自己作主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I control my life.I control my death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.27,1:09:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死无所谓 但不用死充\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to prove how big your balls are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.77,1:09:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop driving like such an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.71,1:09:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.67,1:09:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.47,1:09:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌方向盘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands back on the wheel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.67,1:09:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 不要乱来 - 卡特 掌方向盘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter, stop! - Back on the wheel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.57,1:10:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.57,1:10:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.27,1:10:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点吐出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so close to puking right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.47,1:10:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也怕 但不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're afraid, too, but we're not quitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.21,1:10:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱来 快停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it and stop this fucking car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.67,1:10:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 立即停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I want you to stop this car right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.67,1:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开走 - 开门 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move it. - Open the door, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.31,1:10:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the fucking car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.97,1:10:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妈的 开门 - 快开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open the fucking door. - Move the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.27,1:10:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 快开门 比利 - 快把那该死门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't you open the door? - Open the fucking door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.97,1:10:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开门… - 比利 快开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open it! - Billy, open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.77,1:11:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 听我劝 不要自寻短见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, listen to me.Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.27,1:11:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车吧 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it! Get out of the fucking car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.47,1:11:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 听我劝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, listen to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.69,1:11:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.17,1:11:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要消极 下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the way! Get out of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.31,1:11:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.07,1:11:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,未轮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.37,1:11:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.67,1:11:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我劝 不要消极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! This isn't the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.61,1:11:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.87,1:11:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.07,1:11:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.17,1:12:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的轮到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, he really is next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.76,1:12:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.17,1:12:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.17,1:12:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见到 预见到安全带！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it! I saw the belt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.31,1:12:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怕了没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.57,1:12:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.97,1:12:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,预见到安全带断开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.67,1:12:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话 他又救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved your life again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.91,1:12:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正解！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.47,1:12:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个轮到你 卡特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next, Carter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.17,1:12:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多远躲多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying the fuck away from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.47,1:12:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我闭嘴 - 还斗什么气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Billy! - We don't need this shit now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.01,1:12:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想这样了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need it ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.77,1:12:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要被他拖下水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him! He's next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.46,1:12:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 我还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Billy! I'm not dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.07,1:12:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟早玩完！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.26,1:13:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟早要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.17,1:13:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做陪死鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you ain't taking me with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.77,1:13:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 不！- 该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, no! - Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.27,1:13:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus fucking Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.77,1:13:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have been next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.17,1:13:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,柳敦老师之后本来轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were after Lewton.That's the plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.77,1:13:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来注定死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the design! You should be fucking dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.17,1:13:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是死神吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the devil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.47,1:13:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见到安全带会断！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the seat belt.I knew it would rip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.11,1:13:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像预见爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I saved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.07,1:13:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以救到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the explosion.I saw it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.87,1:13:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警察快来了 - 见鬼 我救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The police are coming. - Fuck! I saved him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.21,1:13:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了卡特 死亡越过卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I saved him, it skipped Carter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.17,1:13:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,落在下个身上 落在比利身上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and went to the next person in the path of the explosion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.11,1:13:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,故此 我如果预见死因…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.01,1:13:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,及早插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I intervene…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.47,1:13:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以破坏死亡设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I intervene, I cheat the design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.01,1:13:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,插手？你当自己是神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intervene? Are you God now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.51,1:13:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,神不怕死\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's not afraid to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.87,1:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,神不会死！我们才会！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods don't die! We do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.07,1:13:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察快来 你太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you are losing it.The police will be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.37,1:14:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我的小屋躲一躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get you back to my cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.36,1:14:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hide out and get your head together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.31,1:14:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 比利之后轮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Billy, I'm next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.51,1:14:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.17,1:14:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.37,1:14:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎也不会坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm not going to let it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.67,1:14:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.07,1:14:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个还不走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you two get the fuck out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.17,1:17:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,生锈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.21,1:17:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,破伤风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tetanus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.47,1:17:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.37,1:17:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一时失察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I overlooked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.97,1:17:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想乘虚而入 但给我识穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to capitalize, but I caught you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.07,1:17:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法斗赢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can beat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.57,1:17:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能够长斗长胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not forever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.37,1:17:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这间屋内 陪你好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got this cabin rigged to beat you now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.62,1:18:16.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1986年 我和爸爸摄于小屋）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.67,1:18:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才还见到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was there a minute ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.07,1:18:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.47,1:18:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是帮你们拘捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not turning him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.47,1:18:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是希望你们保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dangerous for him out there alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.07,1:18:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.37,1:18:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.37,1:18:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要说出他匿藏地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.41,1:18:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先回家等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait at home.I give you my word…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.37,1:18:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把他带回来 加以保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will bring him in safely in protective custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.47,1:19:15.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（教师神秘烧死 余生者涉嫌）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.18,1:19:19.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（家长设立纪念助学金）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.97,1:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有换过位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.07,1:19:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,姬丝黛叫我换位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christa asked me to change, but I never moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.96,1:19:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没坐在托德旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have been up next to Tod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.17,1:19:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 为什么现在才察觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Why didn't I remember that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没换过位 克莱尔坐在我前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never moved.Clear's seat was in front of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.47,1:19:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个轮到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.37,1:20:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车！沿湖畔开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car! We're going around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.77,1:21:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在那里！- 追！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There! - Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.14,1:22:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我们想帮你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, we're trying to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.07,1:22:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince! Get away from it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.47,1:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.07,1:22:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.37,1:23:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.77,1:23:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向那处走 必定去克莱尔家\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the direction, there's only one place he's heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.47,1:23:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.27,1:25:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.47,1:25:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! Stay there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.17,1:25:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！什么都不要碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.77,1:25:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰任何东西 车胎不导电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.You're grounded by the tyres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.27,1:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,车快要爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's going to explode!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.17,1:26:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能抓住电缆一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only hold on for so long.You know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.77,1:26:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.27,1:26:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要避过这一次就安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I do this, it'll skip you, and it'll all be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.91,1:26:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一逃出鬼门关的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we can cheat death again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.01,1:26:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.67,1:26:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 与其同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going to let it beat us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.11,1:26:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我死你活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.57,1:26:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会长伴你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.57,1:26:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.00,1:26:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.97,1:27:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要死 不可以为我牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! You can't do this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.07,1:27:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去 艾力克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.27,1:27:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 他没有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, he's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.37,1:27:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要死 艾力克斯 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Alex.Come on.Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.27,1:28:05.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.27,1:28:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.97,1:28:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎 想不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris.I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.27,1:28:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们竟然再搭飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we got on a plane again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.27,1:28:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我想说什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.55,1:28:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到终于来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird being here, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.20,1:28:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于破解了天机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finally completed a puzzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.67,1:28:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还未完全明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just there's something missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.51,1:28:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.97,1:29:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to Tod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.87,1:29:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有来不到的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all of our friends that can't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.61,1:29:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他们干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.77,1:29:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.07,1:29:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前 我怎也不相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would've told me six months ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.97,1:29:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这里喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the three of us would be sitting here having a drink…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.37,1:29:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 有时候 似乎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.Sometimes it feels like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.11,1:29:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们才明白个中玄机\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two are the only ones who understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.07,1:29:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Browning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.47,1:29:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡是早有安排的 我们躲避过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did skip us.There was a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.57,1:29:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟死神斗 斗赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beat it.We won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.77,1:29:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更应该好好做人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing we won is a chance at a full life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.07,1:29:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要浪费这机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance that I won't ever waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.41,1:29:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点我还不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just something I can't figure out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.27,1:29:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪一点？- 关于死亡设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About what? - The design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 算了吧 好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.81,1:29:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑且听我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.87,1:30:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又来了 - 爆炸的途径…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Just listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.47,1:30:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定我们死亡的次序\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion path determined the order of our deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.17,1:30:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我插手 救了卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I intervened and saved Carter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.37,1:30:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡越他而过 降临在比利身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it skipped him and went to the next person…Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.21,1:30:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着是克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it was Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.57,1:30:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我插手 救了她 于是轮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I intervened and saved her, so it went to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.71,1:30:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有人插手救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in my case, no one intervened, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.37,1:30:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿着电缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thrown from that power line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.11,1:30:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,被炸到弹开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the explosion, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.97,1:30:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你奇怪自己为什么死不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did it skip you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.07,1:30:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你注定命不该绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know this isn't what was meant to happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.37,1:30:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,180班机里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That out of everyone on flight 180…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.47,1:30:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我 卡特注定生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, me, and Carter were meant to live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.77,1:30:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者由始至终就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that was the design all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.17,1:30:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则 下个轮到你 - 闭嘴 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or you could still be next. - Shut up, Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.87,1:30:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩不是我订\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't make up the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.67,1:30:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人插手 死亡才越过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to intervene before death can skip them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.17,1:30:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯三度插手 确有其事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex proved that three times with the plane, me, and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.47,1:30:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能还要\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all I know, it could circle back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.51,1:30:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮着死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get us all again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.37,1:30:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am the safest fucker in the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.21,1:30:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're still next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.47,1:31:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再提 好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just stop talking about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.81,1:31:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's figure out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.97,1:31:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,回酒店吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you back at the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.47,1:31:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.77,1:31:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 不要跟着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just stay here, OK, Clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.81,1:31:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.97,1:31:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出所料 你是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It's true.I told you you were next, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.71,1:31:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, Carter.Alex, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.42,1:31:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear, stay there, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.11,1:31:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.47,1:32:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早说过 你是下一个 - 那就越我而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you you were next! - It skipped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.21,1:32:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个轮到谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's next?{\r}
